WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.230
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Typing: Home Row and Touch Typing.

2
00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:10.877
Type faster using ten fingers. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:11.883 --> 00:00:20.160
Step one. Find the home row. Put your fingers on A, S, D, F and J, K, L, semicolon. Feel the small bumps on F and J.

4
00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:28.704
Step two. Your left hand uses A, S, D and F. The little finger rests on A and the index finger on F.

5
00:00:29.717 --> 00:00:35.344
Step three. Your right hand uses J, K, L and semicolon. The index finger rests on J.

6
00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:46.577
Step four. Type the words sad, lad, ask, fall, dad. Look at the screen, not at the keys. Accuracy first, speed later.

7
00:00:47.583 --> 00:00:51.606
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:51.906 --> 00:00:54.137
Practise the home row for five minutes.

9
00:00:54.437 --> 00:00:56.971
Type: ask a sad lad fall.

10
00:00:57.271 --> 00:00:59.480
Do this every day to get faster.

11
00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:00.827
Well done!

